Most overlay files under overlays/ are produced by patching the serving
image's own source files at build time; any upstream copyright notices
carried by those inputs are retained in the generated outputs. The
step-attribution patcher emits files that keep the original
"Copyright contributors to the vLLM project" header.

One overlay is shipped as a file rather than generated:
overlays/flashinfer_mla_sparse_sm120.py. It is the serving image's own
vLLM source file, licensed Apache-2.0 and carrying its upstream
copyright header, modified here to support no-rope MLA
(qk_rope_head_dim == 0). The modification is marked in the file header,
as required by section 4(b) of the Apache License.

Contributors are listed in CONTRIBUTORS.md.

No model weights are distributed with this repository.
